==> [5/5] COLLSCAN → IXSCAN index demo (before vs after)
==================================================================
Query: find all inspections on car_id=42 of type "return".
Run twice — before and after the index.
==================================================================
Target: {"car_id":3,"inspection_type":"return"}

--- BEFORE index (COLLSCAN expected) ---
{
  stage: 'COLLSCAN',
  indexName: null,
  totalDocsExamined: 42000,
  totalKeysExamined: 0,
  nReturned: 210,
  executionTimeMs: 13
}

--- CREATE index { car_id: 1, inspection_type: 1 } ---

--- AFTER index (IXSCAN expected) ---
{
  stage: 'IXSCAN',
  indexName: 'idx_car_type',
  totalDocsExamined: 210,
  totalKeysExamined: 210,
  nReturned: 210,
  executionTimeMs: 2
}

==================================================================
SUMMARY (real values from this run)
  Stage              | Docs examined | Keys examined | Time ms | Returned
  COLLSCAN (before)  | 42000 | 0 | 13 | 210
  IXSCAN (after, idx_car_type) | 210 | 210 | 2 | 210
==================================================================

